<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Sunway year net up 58 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Sunway year net up 58 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Nov 30, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     33.0     vs	39.0</p>
<p>    Net profit		 75.08    vs	47.63</p>
<p>    Turnover		  278.35    vs     230.24</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  117.20    vs	69.87</p>
<p>    Minorities	less   10.99    vs less  3.59</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	8.0     vs	10.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Sunway City Bhd. It is involved in property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
